===GAME START===
INT. WAYNE MANOR - EVENING

The grand foyer of Wayne Manor stretches before us, its gothic architecture casting long shadows in the dimming light. ANDREA stands near the entrance, examining case files while ALFRED PENNYWORTH approaches with measured steps.

ALFRED
(professionally)
Detective Andrea, Master Wayne informed me of your arrival. He believes your assistance will be invaluable in these troubled times.

ANDREA
Thank you, Alfred. I understand there's been a series of unusual crimes lately?

ALFRED
(gesturing to a side table with crime scene photos)
Indeed. If I may suggest, sir, pay particular attention to the timing of these incidents. Master Wayne noticed a pattern in the perpetrator's methodology.

Andrea moves to examine the photos, noting details with keen interest.

BRUCE WAYNE emerges from his study, his presence commanding immediate attention.

BRUCE
(seriously)
Andrea, there's been another incident. A jewelry store on Fifth and Morrison. I believe it's connected to our case.

ANDREA
I'll head there immediately. Any specific details I should know?

BRUCE
The perpetrator's signature matches our previous cases. Be thorough - every detail matters.

Andrea nods, gathering his equipment and preparing to leave for the crime scene.

===GAME END===

