EXT. GOTHAM CITY STREETS - NIGHT

Rain drizzles over the crime scene. Police lights flash against wet pavement outside MORRISON JEWELERS. Andrea arrives, showing his credentials to the officers on scene.

INT. MORRISON JEWELERS - NIGHT

Display cases are shattered, but something seems off about the pattern of destruction. Andrea kneels to examine glass fragments.

ANDREA
(to self)
The breaks are too precise... This wasn't random.

A sudden movement catches Andrea's attention - a SHADOWY FIGURE lurks near the back room, presumably looking for something left behind.

The figure spots Andrea and charges forward, wielding a curved blade.

SHADOWY FIGURE
(growling)
You shouldn't be here, detective!

A fierce struggle ensues. Andrea manages to dodge the initial attack and counters with practiced defensive moves, eventually subduing the assailant.

ANDREA
(breathing heavily, securing the suspect)
Whatever you were looking for, it's over now.

Examining the suspect's dropped items reveals a curious note with symbols matching previous crime scenes.

ANDREA
(into phone)
Bruce? You'll want to see this. Our jewelry store thief just tried cleaning up loose ends. And these symbols - they're definitely connected to the other cases.

===GAME END===

