The sun rises over Tidmouth Sheds as steam engines slowly wake up. Thomas, Emily, and other engines are lined up neatly in their berths.

SIR TOPHAM HATT
(addressing all engines)
Good morning, everyone! We have a busy day ahead.

Thomas puffs excitedly, his wheels wiggling slightly.

THOMAS
(eagerly)
What special jobs do you have for us today, sir?

SIR TOPHAM HATT
There are many passengers arriving at Knapford Station this morning. Emily and Thomas, I need you both to work together on this important task.

EMILY
(to player)
What do you think, Emily? Should we take the main line or the branch line to Knapford?

Thomas looks expectantly at Emily, waiting for her decision.

