EXT. THEMYSCIRA TRAINING GROUNDS - MORNING

Golden sunlight bathes the marble training arena. WONDER WOMAN stands tall, observing as several Amazon warriors practice combat techniques.

ALEX approaches nervously, clutching a training sword.

WONDER WOMAN
(warmly)
Welcome, Alex. Are you ready to begin your journey?

ALEX
Yes, Princess Diana. Though I must admit, I'm a bit nervous.

WONDER WOMAN
(demonstrating a defensive stance)
Channel that nervous energy into focus. Watch carefully.

Wonder Woman demonstrates a series of fluid movements with her sword. Alex mimics the motions, initially awkward but gradually finding rhythm.

WONDER WOMAN
(encouraging)
Good! Remember, strength without wisdom is like a bird without wings. Again!

Alex repeats the sequence, this time with more confidence. Other Amazons pause their training to watch.

WONDER WOMAN
(nodding approvingly)
You have potential, Alex. But this is just the beginning.

===GAME END===

